menu "Detector status LED"

    config FY_STATUS_LED_PATTERNS
        bool "Show the operating mode on the status LED"
        default y if FY_BOARD_XIAO_ESP32S3
        default n
        help
            Solid while booting, one short blink every 3 s while scanning,
            one every 10 s in standby, and a double blink every 3 s while
            the Wi-Fi dashboard is active. A specific match shows as a
            quick triple flash either way. On by default for boards without
            a display, where the LED is the only status indicator.

endmenu
